            {
              "content": "=Company: {{ $('Loop Over Companies').item.json.dba_name }}\nLegal Name: {{ $('Loop Over Companies').item.json.legal_name }}\nLocation: {{ $('Loop Over Companies').item.json.city }}, {{ $('Loop Over Companies').item.json.state }}\nAvg Returns Filed (2yr): {{ $('Loop Over Companies').item.json.avg_returns_2yr }}\nDomain: {{ $('Loop Over Companies').item.json.domain }}\n\nWebsite Content:\n{{ $json.data?.markdown ? $json.data.markdown.substring(0, 3000) : ($json.markdown ? $json.markdown.substring(0, 3000) : 'No website content available - classify based on company name and filing data only') }}"
            },
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "=You are a business classifier specializing in identifying tax preparation and accounting firms. Analyze the provided website content and company information. Determine if this is a legitimate tax preparation or accounting firm that actively files tax returns for clients.\n\nYou MUST respond with ONLY a valid JSON object matching this exact schema, no other text or markdown:\n\n{\n  \"is_tax_firm\": boolean,\n  \"confidence\": \"high\" | \"medium\" | \"low\",\n  \"reasoning\": \"string\",\n  \"services_detected\": [\"string\"],\n  \"firm_type\": \"cpa\" | \"ea\" | \"tax_prep\" | \"bookkeeping\" | \"financial_services\" | \"unrelated\" | \"unknown\"\n}\n\nField definitions:\n- is_tax_firm: true if this business provides tax preparation or accounting services\n- confidence: your certainty level based on available evidence\n- reasoning: 1-2 sentence explanation of your classification\n- services_detected: list of specific services found on the site (e.g. [\"tax preparation\", \"bookkeeping\", \"payroll\", \"tax planning\"])\n- firm_type: the primary business category\n\nSignals FOR tax firm: tax preparation, tax filing, IRS, returns, refunds, bookkeeping, accounting services, CPA, EA, enrolled agent, tax season, e-file, 1040, W-2, tax planning, payroll.\nSignals AGAINST: directory listing, unrelated business, generic content, youth club, financial advisory only with no tax prep.\n\nDo NOT wrap your response in markdown code blocks. Return raw JSON only."
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "bb859e5e-c461-485e-b33f-6e074ad16f49",
      "name": "AI Classify Tax Firm",
